@ernestkj The saddest part is... You still see the people here posting comments like, "Just jealous of Indonesia", "Bullshit!", "Propaganda against Indonesia".

Even the people are in denial... That's why the corruption will never go away.

Then, again, these people are likely the nepo kids or their families are the ones bribing the officials and getting their kickbacks/benefits. That is why they will lie and say all is well... Because the system works for _them_.

